@RecipeApp.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5105

GET {{RecipeApp.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###
### Private recipe image (sign in first; replace with an owned active recipe ID)
GET https://localhost:7209/api/recipes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/image
Accept: image/png, image/jpeg, image/gif, image/webp
